## Detailed Attraction Snapshots

| Attraction | Key Highlights | Opening Hours | Best Time to Visit | Activities | Tips |
|------------|----------------|---------------|--------------------|------------|------|
| **Green Lake (Cuihu)** | • 2 km walking path<br>• Green Lake Park pavilion<br>• Cuihu Temple | 6 am – 10 pm | Early morning (5–7 am) or late afternoon (5–7 pm) | Stroll around the lake, visit the pavilion, explore the temple | Bring a hat and sunscreen; the lake is popular for jogging and tai chi. |
| **Yuantong Temple** | • 12‑m bronze Buddha<br>• Ancient Buddhist architecture | 8 am – 5 pm | Mid‑morning (10 am) | View the bronze Buddha, explore temple halls | Respect temple etiquette; no flash photography. |
| **Kunming Old Town** | • Cobblestone lanes<br>• Traditional Yunnan shops<br>• City Hall clock tower | 24 h (shops vary) | Evening (6–9 pm) | Shop for handicrafts, try local snacks | Try Yunnan rice noodles and steamed dumplings. |
| **Stone Forest (Shilin)** | • Limestone karst formations<br>• Stone Dragon, Stone Lion, Stone Bridge<br>• Stone Forest Museum | 8 am – 5 pm | Early morning (7–9 am) | Explore stone formations, visit the museum | Wear comfortable shoes; bring water and a hat. |
| **Dianchi Lake** | • 1,000‑km² freshwater lake<br>• Boat rides<br>• Cultural Park | 24 h (boat rides 9 am–5 pm) | Late afternoon (4–6 pm) | Boat ride, walk along the lake | Sunset over the lake is spectacular; bring a camera. |
| **Kunming Botanical Garden** | • Tropical greenhouse<br>• Orchid garden<br>• Bamboo forest | 8 am – 5 pm | Mid‑morning (10 am) | Explore greenhouse, visit orchid garden | Free entry for children under 12. |
| **Kunming Zoo** | • Giant pandas<br>• Reptile house<br>• Bird aviary | 9 am – 5 pm | Early morning (9–11 am) | Watch pandas, see reptiles and birds | Check the panda feeding schedule. |
| **Shangri‑La (optional)** | • Tibetan‑style architecture<br>• Songzanlin Monastery<br>• Scenic valleys | Varies by site | Early morning (6–8 am) | Explore monasteries, enjoy mountain views | 4‑hour drive; consider a guided tour for convenience. |

